    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hezekia yeenjisia abarume abarula eBabeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundaalo tsienetsio Merodakhi-baladani waBaladani, omuruchi waBabeli, yaruma tsibarwa nende eshihaanwa ewaHezekia; shichila yahulila mbu yali nalwalile, ne bulaano wahonile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Hezekia yabasangaalila, nabamanyia inzu yebindubie biobuyinda, mbu ifeetsa, nende itsahaabu, nende indesi yeshiuya eshilayi, nende amafura akashila obulayi, nende inzu yosi eyalimwo ebimanulwabie, nende biosi ebianyoolekha mumabiishiloke; shiabulaho eshindu shiosi, kata munzuye, kata mubwamibwe bwosi, eshia Hezekia arabamanyia ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Isaya omunabii yamwitsiila omuruchi Hezekia, namureeba ari Abandu bano baboola barie? Khandi barula heena nibakhwitsila? Hezekia namukalusia mbu Banzitsiile nibarula mushialo shiehale, eshiaBabeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana namureeba ari Ne baluutsi shiina munzuyo? Hezekia namukalusia mbu Baluutsi ebindu biosi ebili munzu yanje; shibulaho eshindu shiosi mumabiishilo kanje kosi eshia ndarabamanyiye ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Isaya namuboolela Hezekia ari Hulila amakhuwa kOMWAMI omwene mahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola, tsindaalo tsiitsanga olwa biosi ebili munzuyo, nende bienebio ebia abakuukawo bakhubiishila okhuula bulaano, bilachingwa nibiyilwa eBabeli; shishilabaho eshindu eshilatong'a tawe; nolwa OMWAMI aboola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne balabukula abandi khubaanabo abasiani aba oleebula, abalakhurulakhwo; nabo balaba abakhalabani abalate mwitookho liomuruchi waBabeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Hezekia namusunjila Isaya ari Nelilayi, likhuwa liOMWAMI, elia oboolile. Khandi nasunga mbu Okhuba omulembe nende obwatoto bilabeetsangaho mundaalo tsianje.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
